Subject: [PATCH] batman: ETHFIX — Pi 4 wired L3 (bcm2711,mm*-spi board-name arms) (#108)
# distroconfig.txt sets board-name="bcm2711,mm6108-spi" so board_name() returns that;
# stock 03_openmanet_eth has no bcm2711,mm* arm -> Pi 4 comes up with no wired L3.
# Adds the four bcm2711,mm{6108,8108}-{sdio,spi} arms. Whole-file source is our board.d file;
# carried as a patch on the openmanet feed until reported/accepted upstream. Refs #108.
---
--- a/feeds/openmanet/boards/bsp-bcm271x/files/board.d/03_openmanet_eth
+++ b/feeds/openmanet/boards/bsp-bcm271x/files/board.d/03_openmanet_eth
@@ -10,6 +10,10 @@
 board=$(board_name)
 
 case "$board" in
+bcm2711,mm6108-sdio |\
+bcm2711,mm6108-spi |\
+bcm2711,mm8108-sdio |\
+bcm2711,mm8108-spi |\
 bcm2712,mm6108-sdio |\
 bcm2712,mm6108-spi |\
 bcm2712,mm8108-sdio |\
